so she could be...

00:09:34.754 --> 00:09:36.000
Feel she was a part of it,

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.300
'cause I felt bad leaving Christie behind.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:42.080
And Lily came out and
she was happy to see me.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.263
She's not a big hugger,

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.340
but I got a big hug.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:47.680
It was nice.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.770
So, we went out, went
out to dinner that night.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.900
Actually, she had already eaten.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.150
You see, this is what I do

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:53.983
with the women in my life.

00:09:53.983 --> 00:09:55.510
Yeah, right.
I don't tell them

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:56.570
