00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.140
and then they've already eaten dinner.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.360
Yeah, it's a tradition.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.890
So, I just ate some tacos
while she watched me.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:05.090
And then, the next day was when

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:06.400
we had reservations at one

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.896
of her favorite restaurants had it,

00:10:08.896 --> 00:10:09.729
had a good time.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:12.910
And then, she had some school work to do,

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.606
I did a little mount-
You just stayed in the van.

00:10:15.606 --> 00:10:16.920
I did a little mountain biking.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.750
My dad's living in a van right now.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.390
Yeah, I thought I was like-

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.223
He's somewhere off.

00:10:21.223 --> 00:10:22.960
He's somewhere on campus
in a van right now.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.480
I did not park on campus,

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.450
but I did tell her.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:29.727
I was like, "It's kind of like if me

00:10:29.727 --> 00:10:32.350
and your mom got divorced

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:34.860
and this is what it would feel like.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:35.850
When we ate the tacos,

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:36.960
I brought them back to the van.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.994
I'm eating in the van
and she's watching me.

00:10:39.994 --> 00:10:40.827
